<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page team-create"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="team-create-header"><image class="team-create-art" src="/images/home/shortcuts/team.png"/><view class="grow"><view class="team-create-heading">组一支温柔又坚定的小队</view><view class="team-create-subtitle">一起好好吃饭，一起坚持记录。</view></view></view><form bindsubmit="submit"><view class="card team-create-form"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">小队名字</text><input class="input" name="name" value="{{form.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="input" maxlength="20" placeholder="例如：早睡早起小分队"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">人数上限</text><picker range="{{capacities}}" value="{{capacityIndex}}" bindchange="capacity"><view class="picker">{{form.max}} 人<text class="picker-chevron">⌄</text></view></picker></view><view class="team-rule-row"><text>加入方式</text><text class="team-rule-value">{{methods[methodIndex]}}</text></view><view class="team-rule-row"><text>挑战周期</text><text class="team-rule-value">{{duration}} 天</text></view><view class="team-rule-row"><text>PK 内容</text><text class="team-rule-value">健康习惯完成率</text></view><button class="team-settings-toggle" bindtap="toggleAdvanced">更多组队设置 {{advanced?'⌃':'⌄'}}</button><view wx:if="{{advanced}}" class="team-advanced"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">自定义人数（3–100 人）</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.max}}" data-key="max" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">加入方式</text><picker range="{{methods}}" value="{{methodIndex}}" bindchange="method"><view class="picker">{{methods[methodIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">挑战开始日期</text><picker mode="date" start="{{today}}" value="{{form.start}}" data-key="start" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{form.start}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">挑战结束日期（周期 7–365 天）</text><picker mode="date" start="{{form.start}}" value="{{form.end}}" data-key="end" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{form.end}} ⌄</view></picker></view><text class="form-label">习惯任务（至少选择 2 项）</text><checkbox-group bindchange="tasks"><label class="team-task" wx:for="{{taskOptions}}" wx:key="id"><checkbox value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" color="#977bd7"/>{{item.label}}</label></checkbox-group></view></view><view class="team-create-notice"><image class="team-notice-icon" src="/images/ui/leaf.svg"/><view>免费组队，至少 3 人才能开赛。队长开始挑战后，按设定日期一起坚持 {{duration}} 天。<view class="team-schedule">{{form.start}} 至 {{form.end}}</view></view></view><button class="team-help" bindtap="rules">先看看，小队挑战怎么玩？</button><button class="team-create-submit" form-type="submit" disabled="{{busy || !form.name}}">创建小队，邀请伙伴</button></form><view wx:if="{{rulesOpen}}" class="team-rules-overlay" catchtouchmove="preventMove"><view class="team-rules-sheet"><view class="team-rules-header"><view><view class="team-rules-kicker">一起慢慢变好</view><view class="team-rules-title">小队挑战，怎么玩？</view></view><button class="team-rules-close" bindtap="closeRules" disabled="{{busy}}">关闭</button></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="team-rules-scroll"><view class="team-rules-body"><view class="team-rules-intro">不用拼掉秤，也不用花钱。和几位伙伴一起，把好好吃饭、照顾自己变成每天的小习惯。</view><view class="team-rule-section"><view class="team-rule-heading">01 · 先把伙伴聚在一起</view><view class="team-rule-copy">免费参与，队长也算一位。当前人数上限 {{form.max}} 人，至少凑齐 3 人才可以开始挑战。加入方式为“{{methods[methodIndex]}}”；更多设置中可调整人数和加入方式。</view></view><view class="team-rule-section"><view class="team-rule-heading">02 · 约好开始，陪伴 {{duration}} 天</view><view class="team-rule-copy">由队长点击“开始挑战”，按设定日期 {{form.start}} 至 {{form.end}} 一起记录。当前版本支持在挑战期间加入和退出，按实际在队日期核验完成情况。</view></view><view class="team-rule-section team-rule-highlight"><view class="team-rule-heading">03 · 每天的小事，认真记下来</view><view class="team-rule-copy">完成创建时选择的习惯任务，至少两项。每日签到、早起打卡、体重记录均可选择；只记录体重，不比较掉秤速度。</view><view class="team-rule-subheading">每日签到</view><view class="team-rule-copy">当天完成签到后，再到小队页面完成对应任务核验。</view><view class="team-rule-subheading">早起或体重记录</view><view class="team-rule-copy">按实际情况记录，再在小队页面完成对应习惯打卡。每人每项任务每天只计一次，重复点击不会叠加。</view><view class="team-rule-copy">保存餐食会进入健康日记；当前版本不会自动折算为小队任务分数。</view></view><view class="team-rule-section"><view class="team-rule-heading">04 · 看今天，也看小队的坚持</view><view class="team-rule-copy">小队页面展示任务与整体完成情况。按任务、日期和实际在队成员核验；今天的完成情况随记录更新，周期结束后按规则结算。</view></view><view class="team-rule-section"><view class="team-rule-heading">05 · 你可以退出，记录会保留</view><view class="team-rule-copy">筹队期间，队长可以解散小队；开赛后，队员可以退出，队长需要先转让管理权，不能直接解散小队。已获得的有效分和历史参与记录保留，退出后不能继续为本队打卡。</view></view><view class="team-rule-section team-rule-last"><view class="team-rule-heading">06 · 保护隐私，收下同行勋章</view><view class="team-rule-copy">伙伴会看到你的昵称和小队完成情况。具体体重、餐食照片与健康档案保持私密。达成“小队同行”等成长勋章条件后，可到成长勋章页查看；活动奖励以实际配置与领取条件为准。照顾好自己，就是这次挑战的意义。</view></view></view></scroll-view><view class="team-rules-footer"><button class="team-rules-cancel" bindtap="closeRules" disabled="{{busy}}">再想一想</button><button wx:if="{{creatingFromRules}}" class="team-rules-confirm" bindtap="confirmCreate" disabled="{{busy}}">{{busy?'创建中…':'了解了，创建小队'}}</button><button wx:else class="team-rules-confirm" bindtap="closeRules">了解了</button></view></view></view></view>